
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<base href="https://www.nongli.cn/">

<meta charset="utf-8">
    
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <title>网站维护中</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <meta name="description" content="网站维护中">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html, body {
            height: 100%;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f0f4f8 0%, #e8eef5 45%, #dfe8f2 100%);
            color: #333;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .wrap {
            min-height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px 16px;
        }
        .card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(30, 60, 90, 0.10);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .card-head {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a6fb5 0%, #155a94 100%);
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 36px 24px 28px;
        }
        .icon {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .icon svg {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            fill: none;
            stroke: #fff;
            stroke-width: 2;
            stroke-linecap: round;
            stroke-linejoin: round;
        }
        .card-head h1 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .card-head p {
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.88;
        }
        .card-body {
            padding: 28px 28px 24px;
            line-height: 1.85;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #555;
        }
        .card-body p + p {
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        .notice {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            background: #f7f9fc;
            border-left: 4px solid #1a6fb5;
            border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .card-foot {
            padding: 0 28px 28px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #999;
        }
        .card-foot .domain {
            color: #1a6fb5;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .card-head { padding: 28px 20px 22px; }
            .card-head h1 { font-size: 20px; }
            .card-body { padding: 22px 20px 18px; font-size: 14px; }
            .card-foot { padding: 0 20px 24px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-head">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h1>网站整改中</h1>
            <p>Website Under Maintenance</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <p>尊敬的用户，您好！</p>
            <p>因网站内容规范及技术升级需要，本站正在进行全面整改。整改期间，部分页面暂时无法正常访问，给您带来的不便，敬请谅解。</p>
            <p>我们将尽快完成相关工作并恢复服务，感谢您的理解与支持。</p>
            <div class="notice">
                如有紧急事务，请通过原备案公示渠道或主管部门公布的联系方式与我们取得联系。
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-foot">
            <p class="domain" id="site-host"></p>
            <p style="margin-top:10px;">&copy; <span id="site-year"></span> 版权所有</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script>
(function () {
    document.getElementById('site-host').textContent = window.location.hostname || '';
    document.getElementById('site-year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
